Package: simkit
Title: Tidy Pipelines for Statistical Simulation Studies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Riddhiman", "Saha", , "riddhimansaha@fas.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a tidy, pipeline-based framework for statistical
    simulation studies. Handles parallelism, checkpointed storage, fault
    tolerance, progress reporting, and performance evaluation so
    researchers can focus on estimators and scenarios.
